Z||000008||theogre||03-03-2001||04:56 PM||||Bubba, The temperature and oil pressure indicators are 2 diferant systems. they share no common wires except for the power feed to the lamps and gauges.<P><BR>The temp light flashing on acceleration would pretty much have to be something on that wire shorting to ground.<P>You need to check over all the wiring and ground ties in the engine bay. as someone else mentioned also check the engine mounts.<BR>||||reg||1
